Chapter: MqttPacketTest

 A simple test that exercises basic MQTT protocol knowledge.
 The full MQTT chapter is too large for the cross-arch plug
 pipeline (17KB IR overflows the plug's compile budget).
 This test verifies the protocol types compile on x86.

